# T_SCRR: the Works and Tags filters of the item listing and the
# valuation: Works stepped to I with Space, a tag chosen from the tag
# pick list, the listing on the screen, its subtitle naming both
# filters and its Works column; then the valuation of two tags typed
# with a blank between them, sent as one TAG= with a comma.
K PGDN UP UP UP SPACE SPACE SPACE
S WORKSI
K TAB F4
S TAGPICK
T r
K ENTER
S TAGGED
K CTRL-S
S LISTED
K ESC ESC
S VFORM
K PGDN UP UP
T retro ISA
K CTRL-S
S VALUED
K ESC ESC
